    "Use and create email and meeting templates to save time on routine communications.",
  icon: "bx:bxs-file",
},
{
  title: "Advanced Search Filters",
  description:
    "Utilize granular search filters to locate emails, contacts, and events quickly.",
  icon: "bx:bxs-filter-alt",
},
{
  title: "Collaborative Scheduling",
  description:
    "Coordinate with team members easily by sharing availability and scheduling group meetings.",
  icon: "bx:bxs-group",
},
{
  title: "Task Management Integration",
  description:
    "Integrate your to-do lists and tasks to keep all your responsibilities in one place.",
  icon: "bx:bxs-check-square",
},
{
  title: "Natural Language Processing",
  description:
    "Interact with OWAY using natural language for more intuitive command and control.",
  icon: "bx:bxs-chat",
